## Severity

| Level | Meaning | Workspace level |
|---|---|---|
| `CRITICAL` | Cross-tenant data access, auth bypass, remote code execution, secret exposure | {{critical_map}} |
| `HIGH` | Privilege escalation inside a tenant, scope leak needing some access, injection with limited reach | {{high_map}} |
| `MEDIUM` | Needs unusual conditions or limited impact | {{medium_map}} |
| `LOW` | Defence-in-depth gap without direct impact | {{low_map}} |

